  "description": "Coconut Leche is a rich and creamy tropical gourmand fragrance built around toasted coconut, soft white florals, and warm vanilla sweetness. The scent feels smooth, comforting, and slightly exotic, like a warm coconut dessert with a sensual floral touch. The opening features toasted coconut, delivering a creamy, slightly caramelized sweetness that immediately feels warm and inviting. The heart develops into tuberose, adding a soft, creamy white floral layer that balances the sweetness with elegance and depth. The base settles into vanilla and benzoin, creating a warm, resinous, and long-lasting finish that feels smooth, cozy, and addictive. Coconut Leche is perfect for those who enjoy creamy coconut fragrances with a soft floral twist and a warm gourmand base.",
